      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>ARIB STD-B67 Hybrid Log Gamma.</para>
          <code lang="text/java">Transfer characteristic curve:
E = r * L^0.5                 for 0 &lt;= L &lt;= 1
  = a * ln(L - b) + c         for 1 &lt; L
a = 0.17883277
b = 0.28466892
c = 0.55991073
r = 0.5
    L - luminance of image 0 &lt;= L for HDR colorimetry. L = 1 corresponds
        to reference white level of 100 cd/m2
    E - corresponding electrical signal</code>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/DataSpace#TRANSFER_HLG" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.DataSpace.TRANSFER_HLG</code>.</a></format></para>
